                "text": "In the wake of January 6th, @AppropsDems have delivered robust funding to support Capitol security and USCP staff retention and well-being.\n\nI\u2019m committed to ensuring our officers have the support they need at our newly established Howie Liebengood Center for Wellness. https://t.co/9AoCfXwnFf",
