                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "USCP officers work 24/7 to keep the Capitol community safe, & I\u2019ve been working hard in Congress to have their back.\n\nI\u2019m proud to have secured funding to create the Howie C. Liebengood Center for Wellness that is providing the mental health & other support our officers deserve.",
