                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm in awe of Serena Liebengood's advocacy for greater police mental health resources after her husband, Officer Howie Liebengood, died by suicide following 1/6.\n\nIt's been an honor to work with her to establish the new @CapitolPolice health and wellness center in Howie's memory. https://t.co/dnAZz9LhKT",
